<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>狗狗智商排名</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page {
    width: 550px;
    min-height: 970px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    position: relative;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 15px 20px 20px 20px;
  }
  .title-banner {
    background-color: #b91c1c;
    border: 3px solid #ffffff;
    outline: 2px solid #b91c1c;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #b91c1c;
    padding: 10px 15px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 5px auto 25px auto;
    width: 90%;
    position: relative;
  }
  .title-banner::before,
  .title-banner::after {
    content: "";
  }
  .title-banner h1 {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 8px;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "SimHei", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
  }
  .content {
    font-size: 15.5px;
    color: #111111;
    line-height: 1.85;
    padding-left: 5px;
    padding-right: 5px;
  }
  .content p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .footer-banner {
    background-color: #b91c1c;
    border: 2px solid #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1.5px #b91c1c;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    width: 70%;
    margin: 30px auto 10px auto;
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 15px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }
  .footer-banner p {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin: 2px 0;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="title-banner">
    <h1>狗狗智商排名</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <p>第61位: Chinese Crested (中国冠毛犬)</p>
    <p>第62位: Dandie Dinmont(短脚狄文梗), Petit Basset Griffon Vendeen(迷你贝吉格里芬丁犬), Tibetan Terrier(西藏梗犬), Japaneae Chin(日本犲), Lakeland Terrier(湖畔梗)</p>
    <p>第63位: Old English Sheepdog(古代英国牧羊犬)</p>
    <p>第64位: Great Pyrenees(大白熊犬)</p>
    <p>第65位: Scottish Terrier(苏格兰梗), Saint Bernard(圣伯纳犬)</p>
    <p>第66位: Bull Terrier(牛头梗)</p>
    <p>第67位: Chihuahua(吉娃娃)</p>
    <p>第68位: Lhasa Apso(拉萨犬)</p>
    <p>第69位: Bullmastuffs(斗牛马士提夫犬)</p>
    <p>第70位: Shin Tzu(西施犬)</p>
    <p>第71位: Basset Hound(巴吉度猎犬)</p>
    <p>第72位: Mastiff(马士提夫犬), Beagle(米格鲁)</p>
    <p>第73位: Pekingese(北京犬)</p>
    <p>第74位: Bloodhoun(血猎犬)</p>
    <p>第75位: Borzois(波索尔犬)</p>
    <p>第76位: Chow Chow(松狮犬)</p>
    <p>第77位: Bulldog(斗牛犬)</p>
    <p>第78位: Basenjis(贝吉生犬)</p>
    <p>第79位: Afghan Hound(阿富汗猎犬)</p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-banner">
    <p>每日一分钟 狗圈早知道</p>
    <p>关注我嗖!</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
